<li>1 cup granulated sugar</li>
<li>4 cloves garlic, smashed</li>
<li>1/2 bunch fresh thyme</li>
<li>5 lemons, quartered</li>
</ul>

<h4 class="roboto color-dark-grey">Instructions</h4>
<p class="roboto color-dark-grey">Bring all ingredients, minus ice water, to a boil in a large stock pot. Make sure that sugar and salt are completely dissolved, and remove from heat.  Add the ice water to the hot brine. Once cooled, submerge turkey in brine, and refrigerate for 12 to 24 hours before cooking. When ready to cook, remove turkey from brine, and pat dry.</p>
